# AI Coding Assistant Rules (.cursorrules)

This file instructs AI coding assistants (including Google Jules, Cursor, Windsurf, and Copilot) on how to behave in this repository.

## 📖 Mandatory Agent Instructions
You must strictly align with the unified system rules defined in the following files:
1. **Unified Architecture & Rules**: Read [AGENTS.md](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/dowa-it-system/AGENTS.md)
2. **Specific Jules Guidelines**: Read [.julesrules](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/dowa-it-system/.julesrules)
3. **Superpowers Skills Library**: Read [docs/standards/SUPERPOWERS.md](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/dowa-it-system/docs/standards/SUPERPOWERS.md) and adopt superpowers skills for all session tasks.
4. **Project Map & Directory Register**: Read [docs/INDEX.md](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/dowa-it-system/docs/INDEX.md)
5. **Current System Architecture**: Read [docs/standards/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE_MAP.md](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/dowa-it-system/docs/standards/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE_MAP.md)
6. **Windsurf Agent Way (WINDSURF)**: Read [docs/standards/WINDSURF.md](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/dowa-it-system/docs/standards/WINDSURF.md) and strictly follow its philosophy and process.

## 🛡️ Critical Reminders
- **Evidence Before Action**: Read the target file/code first before writing or editing. Do not guess API signatures.
- **Root Cause Over Symptom**: Trace bugs to their origin (e.g. schema, query parameters) rather than using try/catch workarounds.
- **Minimal Edit**: Only modify what is necessary to achieve the task. Avoid unsolicited refactoring.
- **Build Before Ship**: Ensure the project builds successfully by running `npm run build` before completing.
- Strictly check and comply with Supabase RLS and Security boundaries.
- Never write Server Action logic outside of `app/actions/`.
- Ensure dual-write/single-write transactional integrity when editing incidents or approvals.
- Run `npm test` before concluding your task.
- Update [docs/history/CHANGELOG.md](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/dowa-it-system/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md) with Thai description and a precise timestamp.
